mods/cria-files-extended/main.js, chevron-down.svg and chevron-right.svg come
from the "files" mod (version 0.1.15) that ships with the Herdr desktop app
(https://herdr.dev), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, the same
license as this repository (../LICENSE). main.js is modified: the right-click
menu, the file icons and opening files in cria-file-preview were added, and
its folder listing and git marks moved to listing.js, which holds those parts
of Herdr's code. The two SVGs are unmodified.

The icons in mods/cria-files-extended/icons/ are from Lucide
(https://lucide.dev), under the ISC License in icons/LICENSE.
